    "status": "DEFINITION_EXCERPT",
    "text": "Each July regress daily stock return (ret) on market return (mktrf) in $t, t-1, \\ldots, t-4$ with observations over the previous year. Define PriceDelaySlope as the ratio of ]1*beta on mktrf$_t-1$ + 2*beta on mktrf$_t-2$ + 3*beta on mktrf$_t-3$ + 4*beta on mktrf$_t-4$], and [beta on mktrf$_t$ + beta on mktrf$_t-1$ + beta on mktrf$_t-2$ + beta on mktrf$_t-3$ + beta on mktrf$_t-4$].",
    "truncated": false
  },
